sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant B as React Browser
  participant A as Express API
  participant G as Nominatim / Image Storage
  participant M as Matching Service
  participant D as Neon PostgreSQL
  U->>B: Sign in
  B->>A: POST /api/auth/login + email/password
  A->>D: Load user password hash
  A->>A: Verify password + sign JWT
  A-->>B: User + JWT
  U->>B: Select location + category + description + optional image
  B->>A: POST /api/reports + Bearer token
  A->>A: Verify JWT + validate input
  A->>D: Load active user + authorize
  opt Geocoding or image handling required
    A->>G: Resolve place / store image
    G-->>A: Address / image URL
  end
  A->>M: Find compatible nearby open issue
  M->>D: Query candidate issues
  D-->>M: Candidates
  alt Existing issue matched
    M-->>A: Existing issueId
    A->>D: INSERT report linked to issue
  else No acceptable match
    M-->>A: No match
    A->>D: INSERT issue + INSERT report
  end
  A->>D: Write history/audit if applicable
  D-->>A: Commit success
  A-->>B: reportId + issueId + match result
  B-->>U: Show success; refresh map/My Reports
